OL,3,GNEWSAEverything you need to know about
OL,4,Acarnival season
OL,5,
OL,6,FClubs across the south west are gearing
OL,7,Fup for this year's carnival season.
OL,9,FThe West Country carnival circuits are
OL,10,Fan annual celebration, usually around
OL,11,Fbonfire night, dating back to the
OL,12,Fgunpowder plot of 1605. Carnival clubs
OL,13,Facross the region spend all year making
OL,14,Fcarts for the parades.
OL,16,FFrome and Wellington in Somerset will
OL,17,Fhost their carnivals on 26 September,
OL,18,Fwith the Bridgwater Guy Fawkes Carnival
OL,19,Ftaking place on 7 November.
OL,21,FWe have put together a guide of the
OL,22,Fupcoming carnivals in the south west.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
